<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Cheiljedang interim net surges.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Cheiljedang interim net surges.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				  1,398 vs    296</p>
<p>    Net					  12.04 vs   2.70</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			13.37 vs   3.02</p>
<p>    Turnover				  968.14 vs 864.07</p>
<p>Note - Cheiljedang Corp is South Korea's largest integrated food company. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
